WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.090
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:12.360 --> 00:13.450
It will protect you

3
00:13.490 --> 00:14.690
from the backlash of malice.

4
00:25.600 --> 00:26.060
Qi Fengyin!

5
00:52.420 --> 00:58.300
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

6
01:00.340 --> 01:06.300
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

7
01:07.340 --> 01:11.580
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

8
01:15.260 --> 01:22.820
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

9
01:23.180 --> 01:29.940
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

10
01:31.180 --> 01:37.820
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

11
01:39.020 --> 01:45.860
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

12
01:47.460 --> 01:53.980
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

13
01:58.740 --> 02:00.540
[Blossom in Darkness]

14
02:00.540 --> 02:02.540
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

15
02:02.540 --> 02:05.540
[Episode 10]

16
02:14.800 --> 02:15.370
Hao.

17
02:19.960 --> 02:20.740
What are you doing here?

18
02:21.040 --> 02:22.410
How could they treat you like this?

19
02:23.590 --> 02:24.760
Why stay at Mount Zhaowu

20
02:24.760 --> 02:25.440
and put up with this?

21
02:25.480 --> 02:26.250
Come with me.

22
02:30.270 --> 02:31.040
I can't.

23
02:34.050 --> 02:34.910
But I need you.

24
02:36.320 --> 02:37.330
Qi Fengyin abandoned me

25
02:37.330 --> 02:37.900
and left on his own.

26
02:38.270 --> 02:40.100
He still has my master's spirit.

27
02:40.320 --> 02:41.350
I can't just leave him.

28
02:41.990 --> 02:43.300
Please take me to find him.

29
02:48.920 --> 02:49.530
You should go.

30
02:57.960 --> 02:59.130
If you really care about me,

31
03:00.240 --> 03:01.500
take me to Qi Fengyin.

32
03:01.520 --> 03:02.130
Please?

33
03:08.640 --> 03:09.060
Enough.

34
03:10.830 --> 03:11.300
Yinhua.

35
03:16.150 --> 03:17.370
What did you do to me?

36
03:18.110 --> 03:19.570
This prison has weakened

37
03:20.200 --> 03:21.060
my cultivation,

38
03:22.080 --> 03:23.340
leaving me defenseless against these artifacts.

39
03:24.550 --> 03:26.020
But my mind is still clear.

40
03:28.870 --> 03:29.900
It was the Divine Encounter Incense.

41
03:38.550 --> 03:39.780
You don't need these tricks

42
03:40.360 --> 03:41.460
to find out where Yamao is.

43
03:42.150 --> 03:42.900
You know

44
03:44.480 --> 03:45.370
they won't work.

45
03:47.390 --> 03:49.250
But if you keep defying Master,

46
03:49.830 --> 03:51.060
you'll damage your spiritual foundation

47
03:52.270 --> 03:53.780
and may even be expelled from the sect.

48
03:57.390 --> 03:58.620
I've made my choice.

49
03:59.270 --> 04:00.090
In that case,

50
04:01.200 --> 04:02.130
I've made

51
04:02.150 --> 04:02.970
my choice, too.

52
04:06.270 --> 04:06.850
Yinhua.

53
04:08.480 --> 04:09.020
Yinhua.

54
04:09.960 --> 04:10.650
Don't do anything foolish.

55
04:21.320 --> 04:21.890
If you won't leave,

56
04:23.350 --> 04:24.210
I'll stay

57
04:24.880 --> 04:26.250
and face this punishment with you.

58
04:31.830 --> 04:32.300
Yinhua.

59
04:37.470 --> 04:38.740
This is Peach Blossom Paradise,

60
04:38.960 --> 04:40.740
created by the Saintess of the Tides a thousand years ago.

61
04:41.030 --> 04:41.740
This river

62
04:42.270 --> 04:43.570
is actually the entrance to the hidden realm.

63
04:52.120 --> 04:52.810
I'm sorry,

64
04:53.590 --> 04:54.210
Hao.

65
04:57.320 --> 04:58.370
You can blame me

66
05:00.030 --> 05:00.980
or resent me all you want.

67
05:03.320 --> 05:04.100
That year,

68
05:05.350 --> 05:06.130
you carried me on your back

69
05:07.030 --> 05:08.330
and fought your way through our enemies.

70
05:08.830 --> 05:09.770
Ever since then,

71
05:11.080 --> 05:12.420
everything I've done

72
05:14.440 --> 05:15.540
has been for you.

73
05:18.200 --> 05:18.890
Who would have thought

74
05:20.080 --> 05:21.010
the Saintess of the Tides

75
05:21.520 --> 05:23.180
had created

76
05:24.080 --> 05:25.180
a hidden paradise all those years ago?

77
05:26.030 --> 05:26.570
Master.

78
05:27.150 --> 05:28.130
Since Hao

79
05:28.440 --> 05:29.660
has revealed Yamao's whereabouts,

80
05:30.000 --> 05:30.690
can you

81
05:30.880 --> 05:32.250
forgive him now?

82
05:33.800 --> 05:34.340
Qingxing.

83
05:35.160 --> 05:35.930
Take him somewhere to recover.

84
05:37.160 --> 05:38.050
Zhiwei, Yinhua.

85
05:38.800 --> 05:39.700
Gather all the disciples.

86
05:40.310 --> 05:42.050
We're heading to the paradise.

87
05:43.510 --> 05:44.490
Yes, Master.

88
06:15.750 --> 06:16.610
If we

89
06:17.040 --> 06:18.490
take the Saintess's spirit

90
06:18.510 --> 06:19.730
from the shrine with us

91
06:20.120 --> 06:21.780
and seize Yamao's herb core in person,

92
06:22.430 --> 06:24.460
we can revive the Saintess much sooner

93
06:25.070 --> 06:26.580
and avoid any further complications.

94
06:31.310 --> 06:32.050
Danshen,

95
06:32.830 --> 06:34.050
forgive me for what I must do.

96
06:38.390 --> 06:40.340
His Lordship is wounded and poisoned,

97
06:40.720 --> 06:41.730
yet he's still pushing himself

98
06:41.750 --> 06:42.810
to make a magical artifact for you.

99
06:43.240 --> 06:45.660
He's pushing himself too hard.

100
06:47.070 --> 06:47.810
What worries me

101
06:47.830 --> 06:49.370
is the fang the vile black dragon sank into him.

102
06:49.950 --> 06:50.580
There's no telling

103
06:50.600 --> 06:51.490
what harm it might cause later.

104
06:57.070 --> 06:57.810
This venomous fang

105
06:57.830 --> 06:59.140
holds 1,000 years of my memories.

106
07:00.360 --> 07:01.490
Once the venom seeps in,

107
07:02.310 --> 07:03.410
you'll see

108
07:03.430 --> 07:04.410
it's all a lie.

109
07:05.070 --> 07:06.340
You've been wrong about everything!

110
07:09.430 --> 07:11.460
So what if it was all a lie?

111
07:13.430 --> 07:14.290
All I know is,

112
07:16.360 --> 07:17.810
when the mystical flower blooms

113
07:18.630 --> 07:19.930
and that woman returns,

114
07:21.560 --> 07:24.050
I'll kill her with my own hands a thousand times.

115
07:24.950 --> 07:25.780
Ten thousand times.

116
07:27.810 --> 07:28.900
A thousand times.

117
07:30.190 --> 07:31.340
Ten thousand times.

118
07:46.750 --> 07:48.050
Why are you watering the flower now?

119
07:48.120 --> 07:48.850
I'm not going anywhere.

120
07:49.310 --> 07:50.410
You should get some more rest.

121
07:50.720 --> 07:51.290
In your condition...

122
07:51.310 --> 07:52.250
You'll only make your injuries worse.

123
07:52.270 --> 07:53.020
I don't want to wait.

124
08:11.070 --> 08:11.980
This pendant works.

125
08:13.750 --> 08:15.100
My Lord, you lost control just now.

126
08:15.560 --> 08:16.730
Was it because of

127
08:16.750 --> 08:17.810
the black dragon's fang again?

128
08:19.120 --> 08:20.980
This malice is too impure.

129
08:22.120 --> 08:23.020
It's difficult to condense.

130
08:24.680 --> 08:25.900
I need to cultivate in seclusion for a few days.

131
08:34.720 --> 08:35.530
Yamao.

132
08:36.750 --> 08:37.890
Where are you going?

133
08:39.360 --> 08:40.530
I've been thinking.

134
08:41.120 --> 08:42.770
My master ended up like this

135
08:42.790 --> 08:43.530
because he used up all his immortal power.

136
08:43.790 --> 08:44.730
Didn't the black dragon say

137
08:44.750 --> 08:45.300
there's a

138
08:45.320 --> 08:46.460
Mystical Core of the Saintess of the Tides hidden here?

139
08:46.790 --> 08:47.490
If that core

140
08:47.590 --> 08:49.100
can keep this paradise running

141
08:49.390 --> 08:50.250
and even turn a mighty ancient demon

142
08:50.270 --> 08:50.940
into a dragon,

143
08:51.120 --> 08:52.460
surely it can save my master, too.

144
08:52.720 --> 08:53.440
All I have to do

145
08:53.440 --> 08:54.060
is find it, right?

146
08:57.270 --> 08:58.820
So you're going to look for the Mystical Core,

147
08:58.840 --> 08:59.180
right?

148
09:00.600 --> 09:01.980
The black dragon searched for thousands of years

149
09:02.000 --> 09:02.610
and never found it.

150
09:02.630 --> 09:03.610
Where would you even start?

151
09:04.910 --> 09:05.980
I have to at least try.

152
09:06.510 --> 09:07.610
Then I'm coming with you.

153
09:07.720 --> 09:08.100
No.

154
09:08.510 --> 09:09.200
Right now, Qi Fengyin

155
09:09.200 --> 09:10.340
needs you here more than I do.

156
09:10.630 --> 09:11.420
I'll be back soon.

157
09:18.840 --> 09:19.610
If Yamao

158
09:19.630 --> 09:21.220
actually finds the Mystical Core,

159
09:22.320 --> 09:22.940
won't this paradise

160
09:22.960 --> 09:24.220
start falling apart?

161
09:26.910 --> 09:27.770
I'd still like

162
09:27.790 --> 09:29.180
a few more peaceful days here.

163
09:29.960 --> 09:30.460
Form the array!

164
09:37.550 --> 09:38.890
Is Qi Fengyin really in there?

165
09:39.600 --> 09:40.730
Dark energy surrounds this place.

166
09:40.960 --> 09:42.370
Can't you sense it?

167
09:42.720 --> 09:43.460
Or perhaps,

168
09:44.000 --> 09:45.410
Zhiwei, are you afraid?

169
09:45.910 --> 09:46.980
Don't be ridiculous.

170
09:48.270 --> 09:49.700
We just need to hold Qi Fengyin off

171
09:49.720 --> 09:50.770
for half an hour.

172
09:51.360 --> 09:52.220
That'll give Master enough time

173
09:52.240 --> 09:53.340
to seize Yamao's herb core.

174
09:57.720 --> 09:59.130
That sneaky schemer.

175
09:59.270 --> 10:00.130
How dare he make his move

176
10:00.150 --> 10:01.250
while His Lordship is in seclusion?

177
10:02.360 --> 10:04.060
Yamao, you fool! Hurry back!

178
10:04.080 --> 10:04.700
If you really

179
10:04.720 --> 10:06.340
get caught by that old man from Mount Zhaowu,

180
10:06.390 --> 10:07.890
it's all over!

181
10:18.480 --> 10:19.010
It's me.

182
10:22.960 --> 10:24.130
I know it's you!

183
10:24.670 --> 10:25.820
You're the one who led the Mount Zhaowu disciples

184
10:25.840 --> 10:26.770
right to us?

185
10:27.750 --> 10:28.850
And Yamao was worried

186
10:28.870 --> 10:30.250
you'd be punished when you returned.

187
10:30.440 --> 10:30.890
Turns out

188
10:30.910 --> 10:32.340
you went back for reinforcements!

189
10:32.630 --> 10:33.340
Had I known

190
10:33.840 --> 10:35.100
you'd all come to kill us,

191
10:35.790 --> 10:36.980
I would've killed you that day.

192
10:37.270 --> 10:37.890
That was my mistake.

193
10:38.630 --> 10:39.580
Where is Yamao?

194
10:40.550 --> 10:41.530
Stop pretending you care!

195
10:42.030 --> 10:43.650
You think I'll tell you where Yamao is?

196
10:44.440 --> 10:44.890
Not a chance!

197
10:45.150 --> 10:46.300
You've got it all wrong, Miss.

198
10:46.600 --> 10:47.980
Hao is here to save her.

199
10:48.120 --> 10:48.980
I don't believe you!

200
10:49.320 --> 10:50.420
Tell us now, before it's too late.

201
11:28.870 --> 11:29.850
Of all the places in Peach Blossom Paradise,

202
11:30.270 --> 11:31.340
this spot has the most

203
11:31.360 --> 11:32.100
spiritual energy.

204
11:33.200 --> 11:34.370
If the Mystical Core the black dragon mentioned

205
11:34.390 --> 11:35.250
really exists,

206
11:36.390 --> 11:37.770
this is where it's most likely hidden.

207
11:48.320 --> 11:49.100
Uncle Du?

208
11:51.200 --> 11:51.850
Uncle Du.

209
11:53.200 --> 11:54.580
Your sect claims to rid the world of evil.

210
11:55.000 --> 11:56.300
I understand why you'd kill Qi Fengyin.

211
11:56.750 --> 11:58.010
But what have I done wrong?

212
11:58.440 --> 11:59.850
Why must I suffer this fate?

213
12:00.270 --> 12:00.940
I thought

214
12:01.670 --> 12:03.530
having trained under High Immortal Danshen since childhood,

215
12:04.320 --> 12:05.820
you'd know better than to ask.

216
12:06.510 --> 12:07.850
I'm glad you still remember my master.

217
12:08.480 --> 12:09.490
He should've taught you

218
12:10.440 --> 12:11.650
that if your sacrifice

219
12:12.080 --> 12:13.580
could revive the Saintess of the Tides

220
12:13.870 --> 12:15.010
and destroy Qi Fengyin,

221
12:16.030 --> 12:17.890
you should willingly give your life.

222
12:19.910 --> 12:21.820
You never should've forced Mount Zhaowu

223
12:22.080 --> 12:23.460
to go to all this trouble.

224
12:25.270 --> 12:26.250
So you're saying

225
12:27.000 --> 12:28.100
this is all my fault?

226
12:28.750 --> 12:29.420
You won't escape

227
12:30.390 --> 12:31.580
this time.

228
13:03.120 --> 13:03.610
Master.

229
13:04.150 --> 13:05.220
Yamao is innocent.

230
13:05.390 --> 13:06.180
Please spare her.

231
13:06.510 --> 13:07.420
There must be another way

232
13:07.440 --> 13:07.940
to destroy that devil...

233
13:07.960 --> 13:08.420
You ungrateful disciple!

234
13:09.790 --> 13:11.130
Last time, for that demon girl,

235
13:11.550 --> 13:12.600
you defied my orders.

236
13:12.720 --> 13:14.440
I thought you'd misunderstood our teachings

237
13:14.510 --> 13:15.490
and simply lost your way.

238
13:15.960 --> 13:18.060
So I sent you to the Wuchang Prison to repent.

239
13:18.750 --> 13:20.130
But you show no remorse.

240
13:20.270 --> 13:21.370
And now you dare defy me again!

241
13:21.670 --> 13:22.730
Are you really going to force me

242
13:22.750 --> 13:23.650
to kill my own disciple?

243
14:24.000 --> 14:24.610
Stop!

244
14:25.440 --> 14:26.730
Yamao is trapped by my master's sword energy.

245
14:27.030 --> 14:27.890
If you kill my master,

246
14:29.360 --> 14:30.370
Yamao will be hurt, too.

247
14:34.200 --> 14:34.730
Hao.

248
14:47.440 --> 14:47.890
Hao.

249
14:48.960 --> 14:49.980
Don't make another terrible mistake.

250
14:59.150 --> 15:00.490
If I can't touch him,

251
15:01.960 --> 15:03.460
I'll destroy this magical artifact.

252
15:21.790 --> 15:22.700
The Mystical Core?

253
15:47.480 --> 15:48.580
Mount Zhaowu?

254
16:18.670 --> 16:19.850
No more running off, okay?

255
16:22.080 --> 16:22.460
Easy now.

256
16:26.240 --> 16:26.820
Good.

257
16:52.550 --> 16:53.100
Master.

258
16:54.390 --> 16:55.370
What just happened?

259
16:58.670 --> 16:59.610
That shockwave

260
17:00.080 --> 17:01.420
came from the Mystical Core's emergence.

261
17:02.910 --> 17:03.580
Who would've thought

262
17:05.000 --> 17:06.330
the Mystical Core sustaining this paradise

263
17:07.000 --> 17:08.090
was hidden right here?

264
17:11.310 --> 17:12.010
Why did all of us

265
17:12.030 --> 17:13.090
fall under an illusion?

266
17:13.750 --> 17:14.530
It's a miasma of desire.

267
17:16.110 --> 17:18.140
A technique practiced by the Saintess of the Tides.

268
17:18.590 --> 17:19.620
All mortals

269
17:20.070 --> 17:21.420
have emotions and desires.

270
17:22.030 --> 17:22.900
One thought can lead to enlightenment,

271
17:23.310 --> 17:24.250
another to darkness.

272
17:24.640 --> 17:26.660
That's why some cultivators

273
17:27.200 --> 17:29.570
heighten their emotions and desires to advance faster.

274
17:30.640 --> 17:31.770
Even we, who follow the Path of Detachment,

275
17:32.030 --> 17:32.980
fell under its spell.

276
17:34.590 --> 17:35.290
But that herb spirit,

277
17:35.750 --> 17:36.940
along with Hao and the others...

278
17:37.590 --> 17:38.460
Where did they go?

279
17:39.310 --> 17:40.770
Likely because of the Mystical Core.

280
17:42.070 --> 17:42.900
The miasma is still here.

281
17:43.270 --> 17:45.140
Channel your power together and form an array.

282
17:46.160 --> 17:47.940
Don't let it cloud your minds again.

283
17:48.400 --> 17:49.140
Yes, Master!

284
18:01.310 --> 18:02.220
Hao.

285
18:10.110 --> 18:10.620
No.

286
18:11.000 --> 18:11.620
No.

287
18:12.350 --> 18:12.860
Yinhua.

288
18:16.830 --> 18:17.380
No.

289
18:18.830 --> 18:19.380
No.

290
18:30.270 --> 18:30.810
Yinhua.

291
18:33.240 --> 18:33.810
Hao.

292
18:34.240 --> 18:35.180
This place is filled with a miasma of desire.

293
18:35.590 --> 18:36.530
You fell under its spell just now.

294
18:36.790 --> 18:38.180
Keep a firm grip on your Purifying Charm at all times.

295
18:48.550 --> 18:49.380
Oh no! This is bad!

296
18:49.550 --> 18:50.620
The whole place was shaking just now!

297
18:50.640 --> 18:51.420
What happened?

298
18:51.880 --> 18:53.570
Miss, wait! It's dangerous here!

299
18:54.550 --> 18:55.900
- Stop following me! - Miss!

300
18:57.590 --> 18:58.050
Miss!

301
18:58.400 --> 18:59.980
You immortal jerk...

302
19:01.030 --> 19:01.460
Watch out!

303
19:14.440 --> 19:15.460
I'm... I'm sorry, Miss.

304
19:15.750 --> 19:17.050
I was just trying to save you.

305
19:17.200 --> 19:18.330
I didn't mean to be disrespectful.

306
19:19.790 --> 19:20.700
He was trying to save me?

307
19:21.480 --> 19:21.900
Of course.

308
19:22.400 --> 19:23.530
My demonic core is shattered,

309
19:23.920 --> 19:25.050
so he can't sense my demonic aura.

310
19:25.510 --> 19:26.090
Maybe

311
19:26.110 --> 19:27.380
he hasn't realized I'm a demon.

312
19:28.070 --> 19:28.940
Perfect.

313
19:29.160 --> 19:30.380
Let's see if I can fool him.

314
19:34.350 --> 19:35.180
Sir,

315
19:36.240 --> 19:37.730
Yamao and I may be friends,

316
19:38.030 --> 19:39.900
but I'm just an ordinary mortal woman.

317
19:40.240 --> 19:41.700
I don't know how I got dragged

318
19:41.720 --> 19:42.940
into all of this.

319
19:43.440 --> 19:44.570
I'm scared.

320
19:45.110 --> 19:46.250
D-Don't be afraid.

321
19:46.590 --> 19:47.490
Stay behind me.

322
19:47.880 --> 19:49.180
I'll get you out of here safely.

323
19:49.920 --> 19:51.940
Then I'm counting on you, sir.

324
19:56.350 --> 19:57.700
What a fool.

325
19:57.960 --> 19:59.330
I'll kill him when his guard is down,

326
20:00.000 --> 20:01.250
then devour his immortal core

327
20:01.960 --> 20:02.420
to restore my strength.

328
20:31.200 --> 20:31.660
Miss?

329
20:32.160 --> 20:32.620
Miss?

330
20:42.680 --> 20:43.700
She's under the miasma's spell.

331
20:44.350 --> 20:45.220
She doesn't know magic,

332
20:45.550 --> 20:46.330
so she can't break free.

333
20:47.270 --> 20:47.900
What do I do?

334
20:49.680 --> 20:50.180
Miss,

335
20:51.240 --> 20:51.810
forgive me.

336
22:34.440 --> 22:35.010
Are you okay?

337
22:37.270 --> 22:38.460
Good thing you were there.

338
22:45.640 --> 22:46.290
It's the miasma of desire.

339
22:46.640 --> 22:47.860
Once you breathe it in,

340
22:48.310 --> 22:49.250
your deepest obsessions torment you

341
22:49.310 --> 22:50.010
until the pain becomes unbearable.

342
22:50.830 --> 22:51.570
But there's an upside.

343
22:52.000 --> 22:52.570
The Mount Zhaowu disciples

344
22:52.590 --> 22:53.530
won't dare wander around.

345
22:53.790 --> 22:54.770
That means we're safe for now.

346
22:55.310 --> 22:57.010
Then why doesn't the miasma affect you?

347
22:57.400 --> 22:57.900
Because I...

348
23:12.000 --> 23:12.860
What's this?

349
23:14.160 --> 23:15.900
It's filled with powerful spiritual energy.

350
23:18.030 --> 23:19.860
This is what saved us just now.

351
23:21.240 --> 23:22.380
If I'm right,

352
23:22.750 --> 23:23.530
this must be

353
23:23.720 --> 23:25.050
what the black dragon has been desperately

354
23:25.160 --> 23:26.180
searching for all this time.

355
23:26.310 --> 23:27.490
The Saintess of the Tides' Mystical Core.

356
23:29.110 --> 23:29.940
What makes you think that?

357
23:30.550 --> 23:31.660
Master Du said

358
23:31.960 --> 23:32.980
I absorbed a wisp

359
23:33.000 --> 23:34.180
of the Saintess's spiritual power,

360
23:34.200 --> 23:35.290
and that's how I became a spirit.

361
23:36.000 --> 23:36.660
This Mystical Core...

362
23:36.880 --> 23:38.620
was formed from the Saintess's divine power.

363
23:38.880 --> 23:40.250
So we're made of the same thing.

364
23:40.480 --> 23:41.220
I can recognize it.

365
23:41.720 --> 23:42.620
The fighting earlier

366
23:42.960 --> 23:44.460
must have shaken the whole place

367
23:44.510 --> 23:45.380
and brought it out.

368
23:47.110 --> 23:47.860
Aren't you excited?

369
23:48.440 --> 23:49.490
This thing is priceless!

370
23:49.640 --> 23:50.530
And we just stumbled upon it!

371
23:53.680 --> 23:54.660
So you can use it

372
23:54.680 --> 23:55.460
to save your master now?

373
23:55.680 --> 23:56.620
How did you know?

374
23:56.790 --> 23:58.290
Isn't that all you ever think about?

375
24:00.640 --> 24:01.290
Then hurry.

376
24:01.830 --> 24:02.700
If the Mount Zhaowu disciples catch up,

377
24:02.720 --> 24:03.620
we'll be in trouble.

378
24:55.310 --> 24:56.460
What's causing all this shaking?

379
24:57.680 --> 24:58.530
The miasma is gone.

380
25:02.480 --> 25:03.420
Master!

381
25:07.960 --> 25:09.140
If my senses are right,

382
25:09.680 --> 25:11.660
the Saintess of the Tides has awakened.

383
25:12.550 --> 25:13.420
The miasma has cleared!

384
25:13.750 --> 25:15.810
Hurry and find Yamao

385
25:15.960 --> 25:16.530
and that devil!

386
25:18.070 --> 25:18.530
Yes, Master.

387
26:03.310 --> 26:03.980
Master!

388
26:05.510 --> 26:05.810
You...

389
26:06.240 --> 26:07.530
How did you turn into a woman?

390
26:09.270 --> 26:10.810
W-Who are you?

391
26:11.400 --> 26:12.180
What do you want?

392
26:12.310 --> 26:13.380
Not only have you changed form,

393
26:14.350 --> 26:15.530
you've lost your memory, too?

394
26:16.000 --> 26:16.620
Wait!

395
26:16.830 --> 26:17.810
What's going on?

396
26:18.440 --> 26:19.520
I went through so much trouble

397
26:19.680 --> 26:20.820
using the Saintess's Mystical Core

398
26:20.820 --> 26:21.530
to give you a human form.

399
26:21.680 --> 26:22.620
And you don't remember me?

400
26:22.790 --> 26:23.700
And now you're

401
26:23.720 --> 26:24.900
a beautiful woman?

402
26:25.070 --> 26:26.460
What am I supposed to do?

403
26:26.550 --> 26:27.700
She's not your master.

404
26:31.270 --> 26:31.770
How is that possible?

405
26:32.790 --> 26:34.330
I saw the soul crystal transform.

406
26:36.000 --> 26:37.490
It wasn't the soul crystal that transformed.

407
26:38.160 --> 26:39.570
It was something inside the wooden box.

408
26:42.640 --> 26:43.460
That wooden box...

409
26:44.310 --> 26:45.420
It originally held

410
26:46.310 --> 26:47.250
the magical artifact Uncle Du

411
26:47.270 --> 26:48.490
planned to use to take my herb core.

412
26:53.440 --> 26:55.180
There was a flash of golden light just now.

413
27:00.510 --> 27:01.700
You swallowed it?

414
27:09.480 --> 27:10.420
My master's soul crystal

415
27:10.960 --> 27:12.380
really is inside your consciousness.

416
27:13.030 --> 27:13.570
Why would you go around

417
27:13.590 --> 27:14.700
swallowing things that aren't yours?

418
27:14.720 --> 27:15.250
Spit it out!

419
27:15.270 --> 27:16.050
Give me back my master!

420
27:16.960 --> 27:17.440
Open your mouth.

421
27:17.480 --> 27:18.180
Let me see! Let me see!

422
27:18.200 --> 27:19.120
Let me see.

423
27:19.400 --> 27:20.130
Open your mouth. Come on.

424
27:20.310 --> 27:21.220
Big Brother, help me!

425
27:21.240 --> 27:22.000
Let me see. Open up.

426
27:22.000 --> 27:22.810
Let me take a look.

427
27:22.830 --> 27:23.900
- Spit out my master! - Help me, Big Brother!

428
27:23.930 --> 27:24.460
Don't be scared.

429
27:24.480 --> 27:25.090
I'll be gentle.

430
27:25.110 --> 27:26.250
- Big Brother, help me! - Let me see!

431
27:26.270 --> 27:27.620
If the soul crystal is in her stomach,

432
27:28.000 --> 27:29.530
we can just cut her open.

433
27:30.200 --> 27:30.940
After all, she was

434
27:30.960 --> 27:32.010
Du Zhong's magical artifact to begin with.

435
27:32.880 --> 27:33.740
Who knows what

436
27:33.740 --> 27:34.620
she might do to you later?

437
27:35.280 --> 27:35.660
Wait!

438
27:40.030 --> 27:40.530
Miss,

439
27:40.960 --> 27:42.660
I got a little carried away earlier.

440
27:42.830 --> 27:43.620
I must've scared you.

441
27:43.960 --> 27:44.980
I didn't mean any harm.

442
27:46.720 --> 27:48.050
Do you know who you are?

443
27:52.000 --> 27:55.050
All I remember is my name, Duyao.

444
27:56.110 --> 27:57.250
Where did you come from?

445
27:57.720 --> 27:58.810
What happened before this?

446
27:59.310 --> 28:00.220
You don't remember any of it?

447
28:05.350 --> 28:06.220
I know you.

448
28:08.510 --> 28:11.140
You're Qi Fengyin.

449
28:12.830 --> 28:13.730
But I've never met you.

450
28:27.260 --> 28:28.220
Do you recognize me?

451
28:28.470 --> 28:29.200
I'm Yamao.

452
28:34.960 --> 28:36.250
Right now, the most important thing

453
28:36.510 --> 28:37.570
is getting my master's soul crystal

454
28:37.590 --> 28:38.810
out of your consciousness.

455
28:38.880 --> 28:39.860
Do you know how to channel your energy?

456
28:40.400 --> 28:41.700
Then just follow my lead.

457
28:41.880 --> 28:42.290
Got it?

458
28:42.310 --> 28:43.330
We need to save my master first.

459
28:46.550 --> 28:47.330
It's almost dawn.

460
28:47.880 --> 28:48.220
You...

461
28:48.400 --> 28:48.940
It's okay.

462
28:49.400 --> 28:50.290
If you can't get it out,

463
28:50.310 --> 28:51.140
I can help you.

464
29:21.400 --> 29:23.140
The miasma has finally cleared.

465
29:30.640 --> 29:31.050
Forget it.

466
29:32.270 --> 29:33.490
That boy's immortal core

467
29:34.070 --> 29:36.010
might already be tainted by the miasma.

468
29:36.210 --> 29:36.980
He's not worth eating.

469
29:37.830 --> 29:38.700
Besides,

470
29:39.240 --> 29:40.220
I need to hurry

471
29:40.240 --> 29:41.490
and meet up with His Lordship and Yamao.

472
29:57.030 --> 29:58.050
Look at you.

473
29:58.240 --> 29:59.290
You knew you couldn't

474
29:59.310 --> 30:00.180
purge the miasma's poison from your body.

475
30:00.310 --> 30:01.380
Why'd you have to play the hero?

476
30:02.880 --> 30:03.530
I can't even tell

477
30:03.590 --> 30:04.810
which one of us is the bigger fool.

478
30:13.200 --> 30:14.250
I stole this

479
30:14.270 --> 30:15.570
from Yamao

480
30:15.880 --> 30:17.250
to save my own life.

481
30:18.000 --> 30:18.570
You're lucky I'm giving it to you.

482
30:26.960 --> 30:27.460
What an idiot!

483
30:28.110 --> 30:29.010
Just look at you!

484
30:29.440 --> 30:30.250
You can't even handle

485
30:30.270 --> 30:31.090
the effects of a mystical herb.

486
31:40.030 --> 31:40.620
You're awake?

487
31:41.480 --> 31:43.250
Y-You're a little demon!

488
31:43.720 --> 31:44.290
No, I'm not!

489
32:14.550 --> 32:15.090
Uncle Du.

490
32:15.510 --> 32:16.860
Must you really be so ruthless?

491
32:23.200 --> 32:24.620
She was born from Uncle Du's magical artifact.

492
32:25.510 --> 32:26.290
Why won't you even

493
32:26.310 --> 32:27.050
spare one of your own?

494
32:27.270 --> 32:27.730
Form the array!

495
32:30.240 --> 32:31.530
If we fight them now,

496
32:31.640 --> 32:33.980
are we really going to fight to the death?

497
32:36.720 --> 32:38.420
My Lord, get them out of here.

498
32:49.160 --> 32:49.700
Youyou?

499
32:50.030 --> 32:50.980
You can use demonic magic now?

500
32:51.030 --> 32:51.860
Back in the woods,

501
32:51.880 --> 32:53.220
I breathed in some strange miasma

502
32:53.350 --> 32:54.530
and regained some of my demonic power.

503
32:54.680 --> 32:55.730
Let's hurry and find His Lordship.

504
32:56.790 --> 32:57.940
Qi Fengyin and Duyao

505
32:58.200 --> 32:59.010
must have gotten

506
32:59.030 --> 32:59.860
separated from us during the retreat.

507
33:00.160 --> 33:00.620
Duyao?

508
33:01.310 --> 33:02.010
That's what I wanted to ask.

509
33:02.070 --> 33:03.140
Who's that woman

510
33:03.160 --> 33:03.700
who appeared out of nowhere?

511
33:03.880 --> 33:04.730
My master's soul crystal

512
33:04.750 --> 33:05.940
is still inside her consciousness.

513
33:06.550 --> 33:07.700
Let's find them first.

514
33:07.830 --> 33:08.420
Wait.

515
33:08.480 --> 33:09.090
While I was gone,

516
33:09.110 --> 33:09.860
what on earth happened?

517
33:10.880 --> 33:11.980
I'll explain on the way.

518
33:12.240 --> 33:12.460
Come on.

519
33:21.480 --> 33:22.810
Why did you rush in like that?

520
33:24.350 --> 33:25.620
That man was trying to kill you.

521
33:26.070 --> 33:27.140
Don't do that again.

522
33:29.000 --> 33:30.220
I don't need you to protect me.

523
33:38.680 --> 33:39.570
That soul crystal...

524
33:44.550 --> 33:45.050
Master.

525
33:46.030 --> 33:46.770
Forgive me for arriving so late.

526
33:54.440 --> 33:55.730
The Mystical Core sustaining this paradise

527
33:55.830 --> 33:56.490
is gone.

528
33:58.030 --> 34:00.700
Without it, this entire realm

529
34:01.160 --> 34:02.050
will soon collapse.

530
34:02.440 --> 34:02.900
Master,

531
34:03.960 --> 34:05.420
we can't stay here any longer.

532
34:05.880 --> 34:06.730
We must leave at once.

533
34:08.070 --> 34:08.780
We have to leave.

534
34:10.110 --> 34:11.090
So do they.

535
34:11.590 --> 34:13.050
If we guard the lake at the exit,

536
34:13.590 --> 34:14.490
Qi Fengyin and the others

537
34:14.670 --> 34:15.740
will walk right into our trap.

538
34:16.070 --> 34:16.490
Hao.

539
34:17.070 --> 34:18.210
You've been my disciple for years.

540
34:18.630 --> 34:20.300
I know what kind of person you are.

541
34:21.280 --> 34:22.380
You would never sacrifice someone for the greater good

542
34:22.840 --> 34:23.940
and hurt an innocent person.

543
34:24.400 --> 34:25.050
But now,

544
34:25.960 --> 34:27.050
Yamao doesn't have to die.

545
34:27.760 --> 34:30.010
Qi Fengyin, however, must be killed.

546
34:30.320 --> 34:30.940
And one more thing.

547
34:31.840 --> 34:32.820
The woman in white

548
34:32.960 --> 34:34.090
who's traveling with them

549
34:34.880 --> 34:36.940
must be brought back to Mount Zhaowu.

550
34:37.400 --> 34:38.340
Thank you for your mercy, Master.

551
34:38.840 --> 34:39.260
I

552
34:40.000 --> 34:41.530
will do everything I can to kill Qi Fengyin.

553
34:47.480 --> 34:48.130
It's healed?

554
34:49.480 --> 34:50.050
That's a relief.

555
34:50.510 --> 34:51.490
Good thing you're so powerful.

556
34:51.840 --> 34:52.900
It wasn't my doing.

557
34:53.670 --> 34:55.090
Big Brother healed me.

558
34:55.880 --> 34:57.940
Big Brother?

559
34:58.920 --> 34:59.460
How dare you!

560
35:00.590 --> 35:02.050
You barely know His Lordship!

561
35:02.230 --> 35:03.340
Who said you could call him that?

562
35:03.550 --> 35:04.050
Don't call him that again!

563
35:04.400 --> 35:05.380
Let me check you again.

564
35:06.920 --> 35:07.900
You're completely healed.

565
35:09.110 --> 35:10.210
The soul crystal is out.

566
35:12.710 --> 35:14.090
Where is it? Give it back.

567
35:14.440 --> 35:14.980
Why should I?

568
35:16.710 --> 35:17.490
Why wouldn't you?

569
35:17.920 --> 35:18.730
I've thought it over.

570
35:18.730 --> 35:19.490
It's safer

571
35:19.510 --> 35:20.260
if I keep it.

572
35:21.360 --> 35:22.650
You lie through your teeth, after all.

573
35:23.440 --> 35:24.690
And this gives me leverage over you.

574
35:28.840 --> 35:30.340
Don't look at me like that.

575
35:31.590 --> 35:32.650
Make me angry,

576
35:33.280 --> 35:34.300
and I'll crush

577
35:34.320 --> 35:35.460
your master's soul crystal right now.

578
35:37.840 --> 35:38.570
Qi Fengyin.

579
35:40.150 --> 35:41.460
You're a terrible liar.

580
35:43.150 --> 35:43.900
Is something

581
35:44.880 --> 35:46.130
wrong with the soul crystal?

582
35:48.030 --> 35:48.980
Let me see him.

583
35:57.840 --> 35:58.460
Master...

584
36:00.190 --> 36:00.610
No.

585
36:01.360 --> 36:02.570
My master is dying.

586
36:06.400 --> 36:07.490
The Mystical Core is gone now.

587
36:08.510 --> 36:09.380
The only way to save my master

588
36:09.510 --> 36:10.530
is to ask Mount Zhaowu for help.

589
36:11.360 --> 36:12.570
But they're after my herb core...

590
36:12.590 --> 36:13.530
Forget that idea.

591
36:22.110 --> 36:23.010
This place...

592
36:24.320 --> 36:25.460
It's disappearing.

593
36:26.960 --> 36:28.130
Why did she have to faint now?

594
36:29.030 --> 36:29.420
You...

595
36:31.960 --> 36:33.380
There's only one way out of this paradise.

596
36:33.630 --> 36:34.690
If we leave now,

597
36:35.110 --> 36:36.160
the Mount Zhaowu disciples

598
36:36.160 --> 36:37.130
may already be waiting outside to ambush us.

599
36:37.190 --> 36:38.380
Then we'll face them.

600
36:39.630 --> 36:41.010
We have to settle this sooner or later.

601
36:57.400 --> 36:57.940
Form the array!

602
37:04.000 --> 37:05.380
Yamao, what do we do?

603
37:17.190 --> 37:19.010
Even if it takes every last bit of my power,

604
37:19.710 --> 37:21.300
I'll make sure you die today, you devil.

605
37:22.190 --> 37:23.860
I had no intention of fighting you.

606
37:24.840 --> 37:26.340
But you just had to come here and die.

607
37:28.280 --> 37:29.690
You think just because I'm injured,

608
37:30.230 --> 37:31.610
I can't take you all down?

609
37:39.440 --> 37:40.090
Master, watch out!

610
38:13.360 --> 38:14.340
To save my master,

611
38:15.280 --> 38:16.650
all I have to do is kill you.

612
38:18.030 --> 38:19.300
Why should I have to die?

613
38:58.070 --> 38:59.420
The immortal sects have defeated the devil,

614
38:59.630 --> 39:01.420
and it's all thanks to Yamao.

615
39:01.550 --> 39:02.740
Masters of the sects, please

616
39:02.920 --> 39:03.650
save my master.

617
39:04.190 --> 39:05.090
In seven days,

618
39:05.110 --> 39:05.980
when my master wakes up,

619
39:06.360 --> 39:07.860
no one will dare bully me again.

620
39:08.110 --> 39:08.860
And then,

621
39:09.110 --> 39:10.650
I'll go with him to Luoliang Immortal City

622
39:10.920 --> 39:12.300
to see the Wish Tree appear.

623
39:36.740 --> 39:40.780
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

624
39:41.020 --> 39:44.460
♪So many longings♪

625
39:45.140 --> 39:47.220
♪Linger in the web of fate♪

626
39:47.420 --> 39:52.420
♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪

627
39:53.340 --> 39:57.380
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

628
39:57.620 --> 40:01.060
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

629
40:01.740 --> 40:03.820
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

630
40:04.020 --> 40:11.420
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

631
40:12.820 --> 40:16.500
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

632
40:16.740 --> 40:20.420
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

633
40:21.060 --> 40:24.620
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

634
40:24.940 --> 40:29.100
♪Still waits to come true♪

635
40:29.340 --> 40:33.020
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

636
40:33.580 --> 40:37.220
♪I'll stay by your side♪

637
40:37.700 --> 40:41.300
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

638
40:41.540 --> 40:48.860
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪

639
41:02.340 --> 41:06.380
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

640
41:06.620 --> 41:10.060
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

641
41:10.740 --> 41:12.820
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

642
41:12.980 --> 41:20.420
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

643
41:21.340 --> 41:25.020
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

644
41:25.620 --> 41:29.220
♪I'll stay by your side♪

645
41:29.740 --> 41:33.300
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

646
41:33.540 --> 41:40.860
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪
